<title>BELARUS: TABLE-Belarus June inflation 4.5 pct vs 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belarus June inflation 4.5 pct vs 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Belarus slowed in June to 4.5 percent from 5.0 percent in May, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>January-June inflation in the former Soviet republic was 41.3 percent, against 17.0 percent for the same period in 1996, the ministry said.</p>
<p>    BELARUS CONSUMER PRICES    June 97   May 97   June 96</p>
<p>    mth/mth pct change	    +4.5	+5.0     +2.3</p>
<p>    yr/yr pct change	     +68.2     +64.7    +48.6</p>
<p>--Larisa Sayenko, Minsk Newsroom +375-017-227-3594</p>
